{"name":"Bodirer Eichengalle","permission":{"default":0,"x6UCOfoNvCw49QWl":3},"type":"equipment","data":{"price":{"value":0.2},"quantity":{"value":1},"weight":{"value":1},"effect":{"value":""},"description":{"value":"<p>Bodirer Eichengalle ist ein starker Eichelschnaps aus Thorwal und besonders bitter im Geschmack.</p>\n<p>Er wird auch Bodirer Orkengalle oder schlicht Orkengalle genannt.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"},"gmdescription":{"value":""},"equipmentType":{"value":"luxus"},"structure":{"max":0,"value":0}},"flags":{},"img":"material/items/taverne/schnaps-becher.png","effects":[],"_id":"ywigG7Fst1Hd2DWs"}
{"_id":"zP62HJ4p05g5fx3s","name":"Gnitzer","permission":{"default":0,"x6UCOfoNvCw49QWl":3},"type":"equipment","data":{"price":{"value":0.2},"quantity":{"value":1},"weight":{"value":1},"effect":{"value":""},"description":{"value":"<p>Gnitzer ist ein schwerer Fruchtbrand aus der Baronie Gnitzenkuhl (Perricum). Er wird aus Kirschen hergestellt und hat einen s&uuml;&szlig;en Geschmack. Die berauschende Wirkung des Getr&auml;nks kann noch Tage nach dem Genuss negative Nachwirkungen zeigen.</p>\n<p>Er findet bei der Herstellung von Gnatzer Verwendung.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"},"gmdescription":{"value":""},"equipmentType":{"value":"luxus"},"structure":{"max":0,"value":0}},"flags":{},"img":"material/items/taverne/schnaps-becher.png","effects":[]}
{"name":"Rantzentod","permission":{"default":0,"x6UCOfoNvCw49QWl":3},"type":"equipment","data":{"price":{"value":0.4},"quantity":{"value":1},"weight":{"value":1},"effect":{"value":""},"description":{"value":"<p>Der Rantzentod ist ein bornl&auml;ndischer Schnaps.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"},"gmdescription":{"value":""},"equipmentType":{"value":"luxus"},"structure":{"max":0,"value":0}},"flags":{},"img":"material/items/taverne/tee-becher.png","effects":[],"_id":"zlAvXuKZMvEP59Sz"}
